# A PO file with a deliberate mix of workflow states, for testing
# Virtaal's Workflow navigation mode (virtaal/modes/workflowmode.py).
#
# Plain gettext PO can only represent three distinct workflow states -
# confirmed by reading translate.storage.pocommon.pounit.get_state_n():
# untranslated (empty target), needs-work (the '#, fuzzy' flag), and
# translated (has a target, not fuzzy). "Rejected"/"Needs review"/
# "Reviewed" (workflow.StateEnum's other three values) are unreachable
# for this format - they only apply to richer formats (XLIFF, TS) that
# have their own native state field. This file has one unit in each of
# the three states .po can actually represent - the maximum meaningful
# coverage for this format, not an attempt at all six.
